    "text": "He is concerned about Kennedy \"Eroding trust in public institutions.\"\nMitch, trust is earned and once lost can never be regained. All DC has earned is our eternal mistrust, and scorn and yes, our hatred of everything you represent. Everywhere we shine the light we see nothing but rot and corruption and waste and perversion and abuse and, well, everything we would call Evil running rampant and using our money and borrowing against our children's future to do more and ever more Evil in our names. You do not deserve our trust. Not ever again.",
